  "query_preview": "..\nIssued at 216 AM MDT Tue Sep 22 2026\n\nAn upper level low will move north with increasing moisture\ntoday with a chance of showers and thunderstorms throughout the\nday especially in the afternoon and early evening. As the upper\ntrof moves east tonight will see much drier conditions later\ntonight. Will have a warming trend Wednesday into Friday with\nmany low elevations around 80 Thursday and Friday. Expect much\nbreezier conditions as a weak cold front moves through late\nFriday. Will see some cooler temperatures in the latter part of\nthe forecast Saturday into the early part of next week. Will see\na chance of precipitation again Sunday and Monday with the next\nsystem. There is at least a chance the coolest temperatures we\nsee will be early next week with some highs possibly only in the\n50s mountains and 60s valleys.",
